WEBVTT

00:15.377 --> 00:17.787
<b><i>It was a fearsome battle.</i></b>

00:24.877 --> 00:28.807
<b><i>We were cursed by an unknown force.</i></b>

00:31.807 --> 00:37.557
<b><i>We experienced an invasion by a herd of wolgarm.</i></b>

00:37.557 --> 00:41.317
<b><i>We engaged in mortal combat with the bossgarm.</i></b>

00:51.077 --> 00:55.787
<b><i>Then, the well deserved halcyon days had come.</i></b>

00:55.787 --> 00:59.997
<b><i>The threat of the monstrous beasts, 
the wolgarm, was gone.</i></b>

01:00.447 --> 01:04.007
<b><i>And the village was saved for good.</i></b>

01:04.547 --> 01:05.717
<b><i>But…</i></b>

01:07.387 --> 01:09.467
<b><i>I am yet on a mission.</i></b>

01:10.847 --> 01:14.677
<b><i>A secret mission that I have to execute</i></b>

01:14.677 --> 01:17.767
<b><i>without being noticed by anyone.</i></b>

01:23.937 --> 01:27.447
<b><i>I am to scout a location for my date with Emilia-tan.</i></b>

01:32.037 --> 01:33.037
<b>Subaru!</b>

01:33.407 --> 01:35.157
<b>Subaru, whatcha doin’?</b>

01:35.157 --> 01:37.867
<b>What’s with the cool outfit?</b>

01:39.747 --> 01:43.757
<b>Top secret, my foot! My cover was blown 
five seconds after the mission started!</b>

01:43.757 --> 01:45.507
<b>What do you mean, mission?</b>

01:45.507 --> 01:47.127
<b>What do you mean, top secret?</b>

01:47.127 --> 01:48.047
<b>Got you!</b>

01:48.047 --> 01:50.967
<b>I don’t have time for you kids! 
Go bother someone else!</b>

01:50.967 --> 01:54.967
<b>You better not get in the way 
of my date come game time, got it?</b>

01:54.967 --> 01:57.307
<b>“Date”? What’s a date?</b>

01:57.307 --> 02:02.267
<b>A date is where two lovebirds share a special 
and embarrassing secret moment.</b>

02:02.267 --> 02:04.477
<b>What do you mean, special and embarrassing?</b>

02:04.897 --> 02:07.527
<b>We’ve got a secret of our own too!</b>

02:07.527 --> 02:08.567
<b>Go, go!</b>

02:08.567 --> 02:10.737
<b>Come on, give it a rest!</b>

02:09.607 --> 02:11.317
<b>Let’s go, let’s go!</b>

02:10.737 --> 02:13.697
<b>Give me a hand, please, Petra?</b>

02:16.497 --> 02:18.577
<b>Hey, what’s that all about?</b>

02:18.577 --> 02:21.877
<b>C’mon, c’mon! This way!</b>

02:24.707 --> 02:26.707
<b>This is our secret hideout.</b>

02:30.087 --> 02:32.257
<b>It’s wonderful.</b>

02:45.357 --> 02:47.817
<b>Sister, take a look at this flower.</b>

02:48.647 --> 02:52.987
<b>What might’ve happened to it? 
It had only just bloomed.</b>

02:54.077 --> 02:56.577
<b>My, oh my.</b>

02:59.577 --> 03:01.037
<b>{*}Master Roswaal{*Roswaal-sama}.</b>

03:02.457 --> 03:06.167
<b>It would appear something 
rather troublesome is brewing</b>

03:06.627 --> 03:10.757
<b>in the days preceding the royal selection.</b>

03:47.837 --> 03:50.297
<b>Phew. It was just a dream?</b>

03:50.667 --> 03:52.467
<b>Are you okay, {*}Subaru{*Subaru-kun}?</b>

03:52.467 --> 03:54.927
<b>Yeah, I’m good.</b>

03:54.927 --> 03:57.717
<b>Back up. Rem?! Why are you sitting 
at my bedside like it’s natural?</b>

03:57.717 --> 03:59.637
<b>It’s nearly time to begin the day’s work,</b>

03:59.637 --> 04:01.557
<b>so I was charging up my energy</b>

04:01.557 --> 04:03.557
<b>by looking at your sleeping face.</b>

04:03.557 --> 04:05.517
<b>What kind of energy do you get from that?</b>

04:06.227 --> 04:08.397
<b>Never mind that. 
What were you dreaming about?</b>

04:08.397 --> 04:12.027
<b>A nightmare that’ll come true if I talk about it.</b>

04:12.027 --> 04:13.237
<b>Don’t worry about it.</b>

04:13.857 --> 04:16.987
<b>Hey Rem, is it just me or is it kinda cold today?</b>

04:16.987 --> 04:20.407
<b>You’re very right. It is a bit on 
the cold side this morning.</b>

04:20.747 --> 04:23.157
<b>Your intuition never fails to impress.</b>

04:23.157 --> 04:26.747
<b>Uh, the cold weather is 
something anyone would notice.</b>

04:28.707 --> 04:32.877
<b>Yesterday was such a muggy day too.</b>

04:32.877 --> 04:35.887
<b>What a crazy temperature change overnight.</b>

04:39.217 --> 04:41.557
<b>Do you change maid uniforms 
depending on the season?</b>

04:41.557 --> 04:43.977
<b>It must be freezing in clothing that light.</b>

04:43.977 --> 04:46.057
<b>Once winter comes in full force,</b>

04:46.057 --> 04:48.897
<b>I change into a uniform more 
equipped for the cold.</b>

04:48.897 --> 04:53.357
<b>It’s thick and the insides are lined with cotton, 
so it keeps me quite warm.</b>

04:54.697 --> 04:58.947
<b>Given how cold it is, don’t you think 
it’d be a good time to switch?</b>

04:58.947 --> 05:03.697
<b>If it’s hard for you to bring up, 
I could ask Ros-chi myself.</b>

05:03.697 --> 05:06.827
<b>My sister and I are used to it, so we’re okay.</b>

05:06.827 --> 05:10.087
<b>It’s not something {*}Master Roswaal{*Roswaal-sama} 
needs to be bothered with.</b>

05:10.587 --> 05:12.837
<b>Well, if you say so.</b>

05:15.717 --> 05:17.087
<b>Speaking of whom, where is your sister?</b>

05:17.087 --> 05:17.797
<b>Oh, right.</b>

05:17.797 --> 05:21.287
<b>My sister said it was too cold 
to get out of bed this morning,</b>

05:21.287 --> 05:22.347
<b>so she’s sleeping in a bit.</b>

05:22.347 --> 05:25.387
<b>You just said you <i>and</i> your sister 
were used to the cold!</b>

05:25.387 --> 05:26.887
<b>I can’t let this slide.</b>

05:26.887 --> 05:28.397
<b>Come freezing cold or sweltering heat,</b>

05:28.397 --> 05:32.817
<b>she’s gotta learn that a live-in maid 
sleeping in isn’t gonna cut it.</b>

05:32.817 --> 05:33.727
<b>Come on, Rem!</b>

05:33.727 --> 05:36.897
<b>But considering she’s worn out 
from her daily duties,</b>

05:36.897 --> 05:38.277
<b>sleeping in on the odd cold day should be—</b>

05:38.277 --> 05:39.447
<b>Come on, Rem!</b>

05:39.447 --> 05:42.787
<b>All right! If that’s what you wish.</b>

05:55.297 --> 05:56.917
<b>Look at how much dust is still in here.</b>

05:56.917 --> 05:58.127
<b>Do it right this time.</b>

05:58.127 --> 06:00.007
<b>You truly are entirely useless, Barusu.</b>

06:00.007 --> 06:04.717
<b>Are you still mad at me because 
I forcibly dragged you out of bed?</b>

06:04.717 --> 06:07.227
<b>Cheer up already, would you?</b>

06:09.307 --> 06:10.607
<b>Hey Ram, look.</b>

06:10.977 --> 06:13.517
<b>There’s a trapdoor on the ground here.</b>

06:13.517 --> 06:15.437
<b>Any idea what’s down there?</b>

06:15.437 --> 06:16.607
<b>Not in the slightest.</b>

06:17.987 --> 06:19.527
<b>Stop it, Barusu.</b>

06:19.527 --> 06:22.367
<b>What will you do if you open it 
and bugs swarm out?</b>

06:22.367 --> 06:24.827
<b>Wait until I step out and lock the door.</b>

06:24.827 --> 06:26.617
<b>Why do you have to lock it?</b>

06:26.617 --> 06:28.827
<b>Too late, anyway.</b>

06:29.707 --> 06:31.537
<b>Wow, look at that.</b>

06:32.707 --> 06:34.587
<b>That’s quite the stock there.</b>

06:34.587 --> 06:36.507
<b>Is this all booze?</b>

06:36.507 --> 06:37.467
<b>That reminds me,</b>

06:37.467 --> 06:41.797
<b>I’ve heard stories that Roswaal’s grandmother 
was a rather heavy drinker.</b>

06:41.797 --> 06:44.467
<b>These probably belonged to her.</b>

06:44.467 --> 06:46.967
<b>Ros-chi’s grandmother?</b>

06:46.967 --> 06:48.637
<b>Can’t even picture it.</b>

06:48.637 --> 06:53.767
<b>But if this stuff has been down here aging that long, 
it’s probably worth a pretty penny now.</b>

06:53.767 --> 06:58.067
<b>No matter how painful life might be, 
you shouldn’t drink your sorrows away.</b>

06:58.067 --> 07:00.147
<b>Like hell I would.</b>

07:00.147 --> 07:01.567
<b>Subaru, Ram!</b>

07:02.867 --> 07:07.037
<b>I thought I heard someone rummaging around. 
I guess that was you two.</b>

07:07.997 --> 07:09.657
<b>Emilia-tan!</b>

07:10.287 --> 07:12.247
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

07:12.247 --> 07:17.337
<b>I was trying to dissuade Barusu from drinking 
to escape reality, even when life gets rough.</b>

07:17.337 --> 07:21.757
<b>Is that true? Subaru, you should’ve told me 
if you were having such a hard time.</b>

07:21.757 --> 07:23.337
<b>I am not!</b>

07:23.337 --> 07:25.297
<b>I don’t drink, and I’m not trying to escape reality!</b>

07:25.297 --> 07:28.847
<b>I’m not even 20 yet so I’m still 
a minor and can’t drink!</b>

07:28.847 --> 07:31.977
<b>I’m not old enough to browse 18+ sites 
without a parent or guardian either.</b>

07:32.807 --> 07:35.647
<b>“18+ sites”? I’m not sure what you mean by that.</b>

07:35.647 --> 07:39.777
<b>But in Lugunica, the legal drinking age is 15.</b>

07:39.777 --> 07:40.397
<b>No kidding?</b>

07:40.397 --> 07:43.197
<b>And if you want to look at those “18+ site” things,</b>

07:43.197 --> 07:47.197
<b>that’s something I’d be happy to do with you.</b>

07:47.197 --> 07:51.207
<b>So kind! EMT! Emilia-tan is seriously an angel!</b>

07:51.207 --> 07:54.537
<b>Those aren’t words befitting of an angel, though.</b>

07:54.537 --> 07:57.457
<b>Oh, just curious, but how do you hold your liquor?</b>

07:57.457 --> 08:00.417
<b>Drunk Emilia-tan must be so cute!</b>

08:00.417 --> 08:03.047
<b>Sorry. I don’t really understand what you’re saying.</b>

08:03.047 --> 08:05.927
<b>I’ve never had alcohol before, though.</b>

08:05.927 --> 08:07.007
<b>Too bad.</b>

08:07.007 --> 08:10.137
<b>If you were a drinker, we could’ve 
upped tomorrow’s date a level.</b>

08:10.137 --> 08:12.267
<b>Wine in one hand, amidst the flower—</b>

08:12.267 --> 08:15.267
<b>Oops. Almost blew the surprise.</b>

08:16.307 --> 08:18.607
<b>Oh, right. Tomorrow’s our date.</b>

08:18.607 --> 08:21.777
<b>Oh yeah, tomorrow can’t come soon enough!</b>

08:21.777 --> 08:24.027
<b>I’ll wake up early and make us some lunches.</b>

08:24.027 --> 08:26.617
<b>G-Great. I’m looking forward to it.</b>

08:27.317 --> 08:30.237
<b>I hope the sun comes out 
and it’s a warm day tomorrow.</b>

08:30.997 --> 08:34.077
<b>On that note, aren’t you cold 
in those clothes, Emilia-tan?</b>

08:34.077 --> 08:34.867
<b>Huh?</b>

08:34.867 --> 08:37.417
<b>Me, cold? No, not at all!</b>

08:37.417 --> 08:40.337
<b>Rather, I’m a tad hot. Nice and toasty.</b>

08:40.337 --> 08:43.257
<b>What’s gotten into you, Emilia-tan? 
You’re acting strange all of a sudden.</b>

08:43.417 --> 08:46.257
<b>Right! I have some busywork to do. 
Busywork that can’t wait!</b>

08:46.427 --> 08:47.217
<b>See you later!</b>

08:50.507 --> 08:51.597
<b>Heh.</b>

08:51.597 --> 08:55.977
<b>The fact she said “busywork” means it’s 
something not even worth mentioning.</b>

08:55.977 --> 08:59.107
<b>To put it another way, you’re even 
lower priority than busywork.</b>

08:59.107 --> 09:00.357
<b>You’re wrong!</b>

09:00.357 --> 09:01.937
<b>I’m sure it’s just, you know…</b>

09:01.937 --> 09:05.237
<b>She’s so excited for tomorrow’s date 
that she can’t think straight—</b>

09:08.817 --> 09:10.407
<b>Canteens: check.</b>

09:10.407 --> 09:12.077
<b>Bread for lunch: check.</b>

09:12.077 --> 09:13.907
<b>Plans for the date: check.</b>

09:13.907 --> 09:14.957
<b>Handkerchief: check.</b>

09:14.957 --> 09:16.787
<b>Lucky boxers: check.</b>

09:16.787 --> 09:17.957
<b>Last but not least…</b>

