09:20.247 --> 09:23.167
<b>Alarm: check.</b>

09:30.467 --> 09:32.717
<b>It’s no good. I can’t sleep.</b>

09:32.717 --> 09:34.727
<b>Oh, I know what to do here.</b>

09:35.477 --> 09:36.977
<b>One Puck…</b>

09:36.977 --> 09:38.397
<b>Two Pucks…</b>

09:38.397 --> 09:40.107
<b>Three Pucks…</b>

09:40.107 --> 09:43.607
<b>Wait a sec, I’m getting some intense déjà vu.</b>

09:43.607 --> 09:45.647
<b>I remember. I did this once before.</b>

09:45.647 --> 09:47.737
<b>That was the night I got cursed.</b>

09:47.737 --> 09:49.567
<b>That’s just inviting disaster!</b>

09:49.567 --> 09:51.077
<b>No more Pucks!</b>

09:51.077 --> 09:52.907
<b>I know what to do.</b>

09:52.907 --> 09:54.447
<b>One Emilia-tan…</b>

09:54.447 --> 09:56.077
<b>Two Emilia-tans…</b>

09:56.077 --> 09:57.867
<b>Three Emilia-tans…</b>

09:57.867 --> 09:58.997
<b>Am I in Heaven?!</b>

09:58.997 --> 10:00.757
<b>I tried this last time too!</b>

10:00.757 --> 10:04.167
<b>Times like these call for creativity 
and a new approach.</b>

10:05.087 --> 10:06.667
<b>One Roswaal…</b>

10:06.667 --> 10:08.177
<b>Two Roswaals…</b>

10:08.177 --> 10:09.637
<b>Three Roswaals…</b>

10:09.637 --> 10:10.337
<b>Four—</b>

10:13.557 --> 10:17.477
<b>Man, this cold’s got me worried 
about the future of this date.</b>

10:17.937 --> 10:22.437
<b>Those kids did me a big favor showing me 
that flower field. I hope it doesn’t wither away.</b>

10:22.437 --> 10:25.727
<b>Stop! Tomorrow’s weather is gonna be perfect.</b>

10:25.727 --> 10:26.397
<b>It’ll all work out.</b>

10:26.937 --> 10:28.947
<b>Believe it.</b>

10:49.757 --> 10:52.677
<b>So freaking cold! I’m gonna die!</b>

10:56.557 --> 10:59.847
<b>And I thought it was cold yesterday.</b>

10:59.847 --> 11:01.597
<b>What’s going on?</b>

11:04.817 --> 11:06.397
<b>Beatrice!</b>

11:07.147 --> 11:09.357
<b>What are you up to this early in the morning?</b>

11:09.357 --> 11:11.107
<b>N-Nothing!</b>

11:11.107 --> 11:13.157
<b>It’s none of your business, I suppose.</b>

11:13.157 --> 11:15.077
<b>Man, it’s freezing, don’t you think?</b>

11:15.077 --> 11:18.617
<b>I’ve got a date with Emilia-tan today too. 
Is this gonna get in the way?</b>

11:18.617 --> 11:20.407
<b>Such concerns are below me.</b>

11:20.407 --> 11:24.377
<b>Betty is quite the busy lady. I have no time 
to spare playing with you, I suppose.</b>

11:24.377 --> 11:27.247
<b>It’s not like I’m asking you to play with me.</b>

11:27.247 --> 11:30.667
<b>It’s easy to catch something at this weird 
time of the year, so just watch yourself, okay?</b>

11:30.667 --> 11:33.387
<b>Betty is not so feeble that you need 
concern yourself over her.</b>

11:33.387 --> 11:34.887
<b>I wouldn’t go that far.</b>

11:34.887 --> 11:37.307
<b>It’s just that if you get sick 
and do your usual disappearing act,</b>

11:37.307 --> 11:40.557
<b>I’d feel bad for Rem when 
the porridge she makes you goes cold.</b>

11:40.557 --> 11:42.767
<b>Make sure you stay in bed when you’re sick!</b>

11:42.767 --> 11:47.147
<b>Why is Betty being lectured over 
the hypothetical outcome of a hypothetical situation?!</b>

11:47.147 --> 11:50.777
<b>At any rate, Betty is quite busy! 
I tire of repeating myself, I suppose!</b>

11:50.777 --> 11:52.277
<b>Buon Giorno!</b>

11:55.697 --> 11:59.447
<b>So your date with {*}Lady Emilia{*Emilia-sama} was canceled?</b>

11:59.447 --> 12:01.827
<b>Not canceled, postponed.</b>

12:01.827 --> 12:04.827
<b>My hard-won date would be wasted on this cold.</b>

12:04.827 --> 12:06.917
<b>Emilia-tan thinks so too.</b>

12:04.827 --> 12:06.917
<b>Emilia-tan thinks so too.</b>

12:06.917 --> 12:07.747
<b>You’re right!</b>

12:07.747 --> 12:09.337
<b>Yeah, maybe we should postpone it.</b>

12:09.337 --> 12:10.507
<b>Just feel how cold it is.</b>

12:10.507 --> 12:13.047
<b>I know you were looking forward to it so much, 
and you got me to agree to it.</b>

12:13.047 --> 12:15.087
<b>Oh, not that I’m just trying to 
live up to my agreement.</b>

12:15.087 --> 12:17.047
<b>I was looking forward to it a bit myself.</b>

12:17.047 --> 12:19.137
<b>Oh well, you can’t control the weather.</b>

12:20.597 --> 12:26.107
<b>The noticeable look of relief on her face 
is still itching at me though.</b>

12:26.107 --> 12:28.107
<b>I do believe it was a wise decision.</b>

12:28.107 --> 12:31.237
<b>Imagine if by chance you got stranded 
in such inhospitable weather.</b>

12:31.237 --> 12:34.067
<b>Stranded? We’re not going to a snowy mountain.</b>

12:34.067 --> 12:36.487
<b>Wait a sec! Could it be <i>that</i>?</b>

12:36.777 --> 12:37.697
<b>Be what?</b>

12:37.697 --> 12:42.707
<b>During our date, a snowstorm strikes and we’re 
forced to take refuge in a hut and share body heat.</b>

12:42.707 --> 12:45.327
<b>A delightful, embarrassing, titilating turn of events!</b>

12:45.327 --> 12:48.127
<b>Okay! You can count on me to warm you up!</b>

12:48.127 --> 12:50.337
<b>Hold on. I think I got on the wrong route!</b>

12:51.667 --> 12:54.877
<b>Let’s be real, though. 
A snowstorm wouldn’t pop up out of nowhere.</b>

12:54.877 --> 12:57.757
<b>The temperature couldn’t 
possibly drop that quickly.</b>

13:00.637 --> 13:03.057
<b>I just heard something cracking.</b>

13:03.057 --> 13:06.927
<b>Yes. It looks like the water 
in the buckets is starting to freeze.</b>

13:19.907 --> 13:22.907
<b>All right, something is definitely not right here!</b>

13:26.117 --> 13:27.167
<b>I really am so sorry.</b>

13:27.167 --> 13:31.167
<b>I should have come and warmed you up, 
but I couldn’t leave my sister alone.</b>

13:31.167 --> 13:34.007
<b>You… You sisters were warming each other up?</b>

13:34.627 --> 13:39.677
<b>I can feel my body temperature going up three 
degrees just imagining that godly situation.</b>

13:39.677 --> 13:41.597
<b>Why, {*}Subaru{*Subaru-kun}.</b>

13:41.597 --> 13:43.927
<b>You look quite unwell. 
What seems to be the problem?</b>

13:43.927 --> 13:46.637
<b>What do you think?! I’m freezing!</b>

13:46.637 --> 13:49.147
<b>This weather is totally ridiculous!</b>

13:49.147 --> 13:52.017
<b>My, my. What a weak boy you are.</b>

13:52.017 --> 13:55.237
<b>As long as you maintain 
a healthy mind in a healthy body,</b>

13:55.237 --> 13:57.857
<b>no matter how low the temperature drops, 
your composure shall—</b>

13:57.857 --> 14:01.617
<b>That means nothing coming from 
someone dressed to the teeth!</b>

14:01.617 --> 14:04.287
<b>If this keeps up, we might end up 
with a murder on our hands.</b>

14:05.697 --> 14:07.367
<b>Indeed.</b>

14:07.367 --> 14:10.457
<b>I do agree this has gone on for long enough.</b>

14:11.087 --> 14:14.507
<b>Why do I get the feeling you have 
some idea what’s going on here?</b>

14:14.507 --> 14:17.217
<b>If some Winter Shogun’s behind all this,</b>

14:17.217 --> 14:20.467
<b>please deal with it and quick, 
I’m begging you, Your Lordship.</b>

14:21.177 --> 14:24.887
<b>{*}Subaru{*Subaru-kun}, might you be intolerant to the cold?</b>

14:24.887 --> 14:27.347
<b>In winter, I complain about the cold.</b>

14:27.347 --> 14:29.897
<b>In summer, I complain about the heat.</b>

14:29.897 --> 14:31.807
<b>In spring, I complain about being sleepy.</b>

14:31.807 --> 14:34.687
<b>In fall, I complain about matsutake 
mushrooms being too pricey.</b>

14:34.687 --> 14:37.527
<b>I’m your tried-and-true average Joe.</b>

14:38.737 --> 14:40.857
<b>Do you wonder what the outside’s like?</b>

14:40.857 --> 14:42.617
<b>Well…</b>

14:42.617 --> 14:46.367
<b>If it snows too hard, I’d be worried about 
the village farms and shoveling out the snow.</b>

14:46.367 --> 14:51.577
<b>You do seem quite close to the villagers, 
particularly the children.</b>

14:51.997 --> 14:53.917
<b>Eh, I just act naturally.</b>

14:53.917 --> 14:59.007
<b>I don’t actually care much 
for those selfish hellions called kids.</b>

14:59.007 --> 15:01.587
<b>But they seem to like playing with me, 
so I go along with it.</b>

15:01.587 --> 15:05.557
<b>Is that so? You keep telling yourself that.</b>

15:05.557 --> 15:08.347
<b>Sniffle! Wow, my nose is killing me.</b>

15:08.347 --> 15:11.347
<b>Sniffle, sniffle! Oh man, this sucks!</b>

15:11.347 --> 15:15.317
<b>Leave it to me! I’ll make your sniffles all better!</b>

15:15.317 --> 15:17.397
<b>In any event, you have nothing to worry about.</b>

15:17.397 --> 15:21.697
<b>The frosty weather is only present in 
the mansion’s immediate vicinity.</b>

15:21.697 --> 15:24.197
<b>How does that even make any sense?</b>

15:24.197 --> 15:29.577
<b>There are two amongst us working to ensure this 
cold spell does not spread beyond these walls.</b>

15:30.537 --> 15:31.787
<b>Which two?</b>

15:32.577 --> 15:35.087
<b>It’s neither me nor my sister.</b>

15:35.087 --> 15:37.837
<b>That doesn’t leave many suspects left.</b>

15:37.837 --> 15:44.717
<b>That being said, I don’t think I need to detail 
the culprit behind this cold any further.</b>

15:49.727 --> 15:53.227
<b>{*}Lady Emilia{*Emilia-sama}, apologies for bothering you 
so early in the morning.</b>

15:53.227 --> 15:55.857
<b>Do you have a moment?</b>

15:56.357 --> 15:58.227
<b>Roswaal?</b>

15:58.227 --> 16:01.317
<b>Uh, um… J-Just a second!</b>

16:01.897 --> 16:03.777
<b>{*}Subaru{*Subaru-kun}!</b>

16:08.617 --> 16:10.867
<b>Whoa, cold! What’s going on?</b>

16:10.867 --> 16:12.747
<b>Emilia-tan, are you okay?</b>

16:13.707 --> 16:15.707
<b>Is that Subaru I heard?</b>

16:15.707 --> 16:20.417
<b>That’s me, but who cares about that? 
Don’t you have something to say to us?</b>

16:20.417 --> 16:22.927
<b>Something to say… Something to say…</b>

16:24.127 --> 16:25.387
<b>Good morning!</b>

16:26.847 --> 16:28.927
<b>A proper greeting. What good manners.</b>

16:28.927 --> 16:30.217
<b>Nope!</b>

16:30.217 --> 16:33.477
<b>I’m coming in! If you’re changing, then thank you!</b>

16:33.477 --> 16:34.937
<b>Don’t you mean you’re sorry?!</b>

16:38.317 --> 16:41.397
<b>It’s freezing! What the hell is this all about?</b>

16:41.737 --> 16:43.447
<b>You shouldn’t do that!</b>

16:43.447 --> 16:47.487
<b>Barging into someone’s room without permission is rude!</b>

16:48.447 --> 16:51.447
<b>It’s rude! Very, very rude!</b>

16:51.447 --> 16:53.367
<b>So, uh…</b>

16:54.037 --> 16:55.207
<b>So…</b>

16:55.867 --> 16:57.037
<b>Do it over again!</b>

16:57.037 --> 16:59.377
<b>Or so she says.</b>

16:59.377 --> 17:02.087
<b>What does the master of the household think?</b>

17:02.087 --> 17:04.757
<b>Permission to enter: granted!</b>

17:04.757 --> 17:06.587
<b>Roswaal!</b>

17:06.587 --> 17:09.297
<b>So, what’s the deal with this cold?</b>

17:09.297 --> 17:11.677
<b>Deal? Whatever do you mean?</b>

17:11.677 --> 17:15.557
<b>Nothing. Well, maybe not nothing. I don’t know!</b>

17:15.557 --> 17:17.227
<b>It’s okay, Lia.</b>

17:17.227 --> 17:21.187
<b>It doesn’t seem like we can hide it any longer.</b>

17:22.527 --> 17:24.357
<b>Puck, you idiot!</b>

17:24.357 --> 17:26.147
<b>I just about had them fooled!</b>

17:26.147 --> 17:29.407
<b>No way. Not in a hundred years.</b>

17:30.487 --> 17:34.577
<b>Sorry. I caused trouble for you.</b>

17:34.577 --> 17:36.917
<b>Don’t be mad at Lia and Betty.</b>

17:37.827 --> 17:41.877
<b>The two of them were just looking out for me.</b>

17:44.917 --> 17:47.087
<b>Manastruation?</b>

17:47.087 --> 17:50.717
<b>What’s manastruation? 
Don’t you mean menstruation?</b>

17:50.717 --> 17:54.597
<b>I’m not a girl, silly. I don’t menstruate.</b>

17:54.597 --> 17:56.517
<b>That was totally uncalled for.</b>

17:57.137 --> 17:59.477
<b>I’m not sure where to begin with that.</b>

17:59.767 --> 18:04.357
<b>It’s a phenomenon that only affects 
a select few powerful magical beings.</b>

18:04.647 --> 18:09.867
<b>Magical potency is determined by one’s 
Od attributes, so it is highly restricted.</b>

18:09.867 --> 18:14.487
<b>Od? Is that something different 
from mana and gates?</b>

18:14.747 --> 18:18.037
<b>You don’t even know about Od? 
I’m starting to doubt your common sense.</b>

18:18.037 --> 18:20.497
<b>You’ve gone as far as you can in ignorance 
and shallow thinking, Barusu.</b>

18:20.827 --> 18:24.627
<b>You’re even harsher than usual. 
Is the cold a weak point of yours?</b>

18:24.917 --> 18:28.797
<b>The idea of strong and weak points 
is entirely subjective.</b>

18:28.797 --> 18:32.597
<b>I don’t look at things so narrow-mindedly.</b>

18:32.597 --> 18:34.767
<b>Keep your idiocy to yourself.</b>

18:34.767 --> 18:35.517
<b>Do us a favor and die.</b>

18:35.517 --> 18:37.347
<b>That last part was some low-effort criticism!</b>

18:37.597 --> 18:41.857
<b>This conversation will never go anywhere 
if I leave it to the lot of you, I suppose.</b>

18:41.857 --> 18:45.107
<b>Betty has no choice but to explain it herself.</b>

18:45.107 --> 18:49.947
<b>Od is the vessel of magical power. 
It stores the mana absorbed through your gate.</b>

18:49.947 --> 18:54.527
<b>Ooh, aah! A vessel that stores mana. 
Please, do continue.</b>

18:54.527 --> 18:57.747
<b>Your manner of phrasing irritates me.</b>

18:57.747 --> 19:01.497
<b>To continue, the greater one’s Od, 
the more mana one can use.</b>

19:01.497 --> 19:05.207
<b>However, it still has a limit 
as to how much it can store.</b>

19:05.207 --> 19:10.427
<b>Once the limit is reached, 
it overflows with mana.</b>

19:10.427 --> 19:14.137
<b>It’s important to expend it 
before it gets to that point.</b>

19:14.137 --> 19:17.717
<b>Like letting it out before your stomach bursts?</b>

19:18.597 --> 19:20.387
<b>So being constipated in a way?</b>

19:20.937 --> 19:23.057
<b>You should think before you speak, I suppose!</b>

19:23.057 --> 19:27.977
<b>So Puck venting out his mana 
is the reason for this cold?</b>

19:27.977 --> 19:30.447
<b>Yes, that’s right.</b>

19:30.447 --> 19:32.777
<b>I’m sorry for not telling you.</b>

19:32.777 --> 19:35.367
<b>That’s one annoying way to relieve constipation.</b>

19:35.827 --> 19:38.037
<b>Does this happen regularly?</b>

19:38.037 --> 19:40.037
<b>Once a year, maybe?</b>

19:40.037 --> 19:44.377
<b>When I was living in the forest with Lia, 
I was able to release enough energy,</b>

19:44.377 --> 19:47.417
<b>but since coming here, I’ve been trying to behave.</b>

19:47.417 --> 19:49.547
<b>I guess this is the result!</b>

19:49.547 --> 19:50.507
<b>Teehee!</b>

19:50.507 --> 19:52.217
<b>Teehee, my ass!</b>

19:52.217 --> 19:56.007
<b>Well, I won’t complain if you really 
need to release your magic.</b>

19:56.007 --> 19:59.977
<b>But why did it get so strong 
over the last three days?</b>

20:00.307 --> 20:03.097
<b>At first, I was taking it slowly.</b>

20:03.097 --> 20:06.147
<b>But since I had more mana stored than usual,</b>

20:06.147 --> 20:09.067
<b>and nobody was complaining 
about the cold anyways…</b>

20:09.067 --> 20:11.987
<b>“Ooh, can I turn it up a bit more?”</b>

20:11.987 --> 20:13.857
<b>“Yeah, I’m good!”</b>

20:13.857 --> 20:15.907
<b>“People are dumber than I thought.”</b>

20:15.907 --> 20:16.657
<b>Something like that.</b>

20:16.657 --> 20:17.947
<b>That’s some sloppy thinking!</b>

20:18.287 --> 20:23.417
<b>A Great Spirit of his caliber can’t vent it 
all out no matter how hard he tries.</b>

20:23.417 --> 20:28.797
<b>Now, out of respect for Bubby’s adorableness 
and luscious fur, quit besmirching him.</b>

20:28.797 --> 20:31.007
<b>You’ve got a runny nose yourself!</b>

20:31.007 --> 20:33.377
<b>It was you, right?</b>

20:33.377 --> 20:37.427
<b>You’re the one who did whatever trick to keep 
the cold in because you were afraid we’d find out.</b>

20:37.427 --> 20:38.967
<b>Answer me honestly.</b>

20:39.387 --> 20:41.267
<b>She’s blowing her nose!</b>

20:41.267 --> 20:44.187
<b>I haven’t the faintest idea 
what you’re talking about.</b>

20:46.307 --> 20:47.647
<b>Um…</b>

20:47.937 --> 20:52.847
<b>Puck and I are really sorry about this.</b>

20:53.447 --> 20:57.197
<b>But his manastruation should be over soon.</b>

20:57.197 --> 20:58.867
<b>Right, Puck?</b>

20:58.867 --> 21:03.247
<b>Yeah, if you let me continue at this pace 
for another 2 days, I’ll be all good.</b>

21:03.247 --> 21:08.587
<b>If you continue at this pace, Ram and I will 
be frozen corpses by tomorrow morning.</b>

21:09.207 --> 21:12.257
<b>And Emilia-tan, aren’t you cold dressed like that?</b>

21:12.257 --> 21:14.927
<b>I wanna see winter-clothes version Emilia-tan!</b>

21:14.007 --> 21:14.927
<b>So, um…</b>

21:14.927 --> 21:17.587
<b>You know my contract with Puck?</b>

21:18.217 --> 21:23.347
<b>The thing is, it lets me control 
how much I’m affected by his magic.</b>

21:24.017 --> 21:25.057
<b>That’s why…</b>

21:25.637 --> 21:31.187
<b>As cold as it may be, yes, I’m fine.</b>

21:31.187 --> 21:35.107
<b>Don’t you feel bad about causing 
this much trouble for your daughter?</b>

21:35.107 --> 21:37.417
<b>There’s gotta be another way.</b>

21:38.527 --> 21:39.527
<b>Aha!</b>

21:39.527 --> 21:42.447
<b>There’s no reason we have to stay inside the mansion!</b>

21:42.447 --> 21:45.157
<b>As long as Beako contains the chill with her barrier,</b>

21:45.157 --> 21:48.417
<b>we can live outside the mansion.</b>

21:48.417 --> 21:51.337
<b>Quick thinking, {*}Subaru{*Subaru-kun}! I’m in total awe!</b>

21:51.337 --> 21:53.547
<b>This time of year, the weather outside 
is neither hot nor cold.</b>

21:57.047 --> 21:59.717
<b>Given this downpour, I don’t suppose 
it’ll be letting up any time soon.</b>

21:59.717 --> 22:01.007
<b>Why, cruel world?!</b>

22:01.007 --> 22:03.007
<b>Camping outside doesn’t seem like an option.</b>

22:03.007 --> 22:04.677
<b>No, as long as we have a tent—</b>

22:04.677 --> 22:06.637
<b>{*}Subaru{*Subaru-kun}!</b>

22:06.637 --> 22:12.607
<b>Were you planning to make me, 
the master of this mansion, camp outside?</b>

22:12.607 --> 22:16.357
<b>Th-Then, can’t you do something with your magic?</b>

22:16.357 --> 22:22.577
<b>Like, send some kind of fiery ball flying at Puck 
and even out the temperature?</b>

22:22.577 --> 22:25.197
<b>It would be hard to control that.</b>

22:25.197 --> 22:29.247
<b>If my hand slipped even a little, 
the mansion would be a sea of flames.</b>

22:29.707 --> 22:34.377
<b>What’s with this “raging floods from above, 
raging flames from below” situation?</b>

22:34.377 --> 22:37.587
<b>Oh, I got it! “Raging floods from above, 
raging flames from below!”</b>

22:37.877 --> 22:39.047
<b>What do you mean?</b>

22:39.047 --> 22:42.257
<b>It’s a famous riddle where I come from.</b>

22:42.257 --> 22:44.507
<b>The answer is: the bath!</b>

22:44.507 --> 22:47.267
<b>It means that, to overcome 
this freezing cold, we must…</b>

22:47.267 --> 22:48.977
<b>We must…</b>

22:48.977 --> 22:53.397
<b>We must use all the fire stones in the mansion 
to heat the water in the bathing pool!</b>

22:53.397 --> 22:54.267
<b>And…</b>

22:54.937 --> 22:56.937
<b>For two days, we’ll all carry out…</b>

22:57.897 --> 22:59.817
<b>“Operation: Hot Spring”! How’s that?</b>

22:59.817 --> 23:02.907
<b>Quick thinking, {*}Subaru{*Subaru-kun}! I’m in total awe!</b>

23:02.907 --> 23:05.327
<b>I hate to rain on your parade, 
but that won’t be possible.</b>

23:06.157 --> 23:07.617
<b>Why not?</b>

23:12.787 --> 23:15.707
<b>This is… mayonnaise?</b>

23:15.707 --> 23:20.377
<b>That it is! I’m doing my best to make mayonnaise 
for you, {*}Subaru{*Subaru-kun}, the mayo lover.</b>

23:20.377 --> 23:21.757
<b>Not too long ago,</b>

23:27.307 --> 23:32.897
<b>you got angry at me because we 
didn’t have enough mayonnaise.</b>

23:27.307 --> 23:32.897
<b>you got angry at me because we 
didn’t have enough mayonnaise.</b>

23:32.897 --> 23:35.267
<b>Now, you’ll have a full bathing pool of it!</b>

23:39.187 --> 23:41.697
<b>I wouldn’t say no to a little praise.</b>

23:43.067 --> 23:45.027
<b>Are you an idiot?!</b>

23:45.617 --> 23:47.787
<b>Indeed, the mayonnaise is frozen!</b>

23:47.787 --> 23:49.117
<b>That’s not the issue!</b>

23:49.117 --> 23:50.957
<b>It’s okay, {*}Subaru{*Subaru-kun}!</b>

23:50.957 --> 23:53.537
<b>Once we heat it, it will turn into 
warm mayonnaise bath water!</b>

23:53.537 --> 23:54.917
<b>Just stop it!</b>

23:54.917 --> 23:57.457
<b>You’ll be hated by mayo lovers 
from all over the world!</b>

24:01.587 --> 24:04.967
<b>Even right next to the fireplace, 
it’s still freaking cold.</b>

24:04.967 --> 24:08.967
<b>Without this fire, everyone in this 
mansion would be frozen solid.</b>

24:08.967 --> 24:10.137
<b>Wanna try it?</b>

24:10.137 --> 24:11.887
<b>I’ll give that a hard pass!</b>

24:11.887 --> 24:18.187
<b>Instead of releasing it slowly over two days, 
can’t you shoot a big spell into the sky or something?</b>

24:18.647 --> 24:21.397
<b>Oh, does that mean what I think it does?</b>

24:21.777 --> 24:25.867
<b>I have your permission to wrought 
destruction upon the world.</b>

24:25.867 --> 24:27.617
<b>Like hell!</b>

24:27.617 --> 24:29.237
<b>It was a joke.</b>

24:28.237 --> 24:31.997
<b>Does this manastruation ordeal only affect spirits?</b>

24:31.997 --> 24:33.617
<b>What about you two?</b>

24:33.617 --> 24:39.417
<b>I handle it by expending magical energy every day.</b>

24:39.417 --> 24:41.337
<b>I have daily business that needs attending to.</b>

24:44.967 --> 24:47.677
<b>My Od is never without space.</b>

24:47.677 --> 24:50.057
<b>Why did Ram react to hearing 
about your daily business?</b>

24:50.887 --> 24:53.767
<b>Oh, never mind, I don’t really want to know.</b>

24:54.137 --> 24:58.307
<b>Betty uses her energy to manage 
the Forbidden Library and Door Crossing.</b>

24:58.307 --> 25:03.607
<b>Oh right, I’ve also used it to send 
a loud-mouthed person flying as of late.</b>

25:03.607 --> 25:05.947
<b>Yeah, yeah. Very cute.</b>

25:05.947 --> 25:08.277
<b>And how about you two?</b>

25:08.277 --> 25:12.747
<b>Do you menstru— Er, uh… I mean manastruate?</b>

25:12.747 --> 25:18.207
<b>Only a select few have the extraordinary attributes 
required to undergo manastruation.</b>

25:18.207 --> 25:23.717
<b>I’m not much of a magic user myself, 
so it doesn’t happen to me.</b>

25:23.717 --> 25:28.297
<b>But I have a lot of experience with it because of Puck.</b>

25:28.297 --> 25:32.387
<b>So, um… Sorry about all this. 
I’ll watch out in the future.</b>

25:32.387 --> 25:35.187
<b>Emilia-tan’s really putting herself down today.</b>

25:35.517 --> 25:40.267
<b>All right. When’s the last time you really 
used a good amount of magic, Puck?</b>

25:40.267 --> 25:41.567
<b>I’m curious.</b>

25:42.107 --> 25:46.527
<b>In recent times, probably fighting that 
black-clad woman in the capital?</b>

25:46.857 --> 25:48.867
<b>I even ran out of mana then.</b>

25:48.867 --> 25:52.447
<b>We can’t invite an enemy that strong 
to come and fight again!</b>

25:52.447 --> 25:56.497
<b>Death from evisceration, or death 
from freezing. It’s a total lose-lose.</b>

25:56.497 --> 26:00.707
<b>Other than that, it would be when Roswaal came 
to pick up Emilia from the forest.</b>

26:00.707 --> 26:04.627
<b>It’s embarassing, but I feel like I caused 
a big commotion that time.</b>

26:04.627 --> 26:08.587
<b>Oh yes, that was indeed quite stimulating.</b>

26:09.177 --> 26:16.677
<b>Even for me, a magic battle 
on that level was a new experience.</b>

26:16.677 --> 26:19.937
<b>I was so surprised when you 
turned up unannounced like that!</b>

26:20.937 --> 26:25.817
<b>We went at it for an entire day.</b>

26:25.817 --> 26:28.567
<b>What actually happened, Emilia-tan?</b>

26:28.567 --> 26:32.907
<b>I heard they had to redraw the map afterwards.</b>

26:32.907 --> 26:34.367
<b>Okay, not okay!</b>

26:34.367 --> 26:37.407
<b>The “foe in a friend” plan is an absolute no-go!</b>

26:37.407 --> 26:38.327
<b>Aw man!</b>

26:38.327 --> 26:41.287
<b>Don’t give me that! Don’t change the map fighting!</b>

26:41.287 --> 26:43.037
<b>Apologize to Inou Tadataka!</b>

26:43.037 --> 26:46.757
<b>Sorry, {*}Mister Tadataka{*Tadataka-san}!</b>

26:43.037 --> 26:46.757
<b>TL Note: Inou Tadataka is a famous Japanese Cartographer</b>

26:47.757 --> 26:48.877
<b>Was that okay?</b>

26:52.637 --> 26:56.427
<b>In any case, we shouldn’t let the fire go out.</b>

26:56.427 --> 26:58.597
<b>I’m really sorry.</b>

26:58.597 --> 27:02.767
<b>When I was in the forest with Puck, 
there wasn’t anyone to be bothered.</b>

27:02.767 --> 27:06.187
<b>I didn’t think his manastruation 
would be such a problem.</b>

27:06.187 --> 27:09.447
<b>No, I won’t let you apologize any more.</b>

27:09.447 --> 27:11.737
<b>I’ll do something about it.</b>

27:11.737 --> 27:13.737
<b>There’s no such thing as an endless night.</b>

27:13.737 --> 27:15.407
<b>There’s no such thing as endless rain.</b>

27:17.367 --> 27:19.367
<b>Hmm… Rain, huh?</b>

27:19.957 --> 27:22.667
<b>If the rain continues into the night… No.</b>

27:22.667 --> 27:27.087
<b>Night or not, if it’s cold enough it turns into snow.</b>

27:27.087 --> 27:30.677
<b>Subaru? Did you get another funny idea?</b>

27:30.677 --> 27:33.967
<b>Quick thinking, {*}Subaru{*Subaru-kun}! I’m in total awe!</b>

27:34.387 --> 27:36.177
<b>Don’t get your hopes up yet.</b>

27:36.177 --> 27:37.557
<b>And you’re too easy to wow.</b>

27:37.967 --> 27:40.307
<b>But I finally got an idea.</b>

27:40.307 --> 27:42.517
<b>Not a band-aid solution, but a peaceful,</b>

27:42.517 --> 27:47.477
<b>interesting, and fun way of dealing 
with this manastruation.</b>

27:47.477 --> 27:49.937
<b>What do you mean?</b>

27:50.357 --> 27:52.817
<b>In my homeland of Hokkaido…</b>

27:52.817 --> 27:56.027
<b>Homeland in a broad sense, anyway.</b>

27:56.027 --> 27:57.987
<b>There are festivals!</b>

27:57.987 --> 28:01.657
<b>Let’s squander all of Puck’s stored mana!</b>

28:02.617 --> 28:03.627
<b>I dub thee:</b>

28:04.287 --> 28:11.507
<b>the first Chitty-Chitty Roswaal 
Manor Snow Festival!</b>

28:11.507 --> 28:14.837
<b>Quick thinking, {*}Subaru{*Subaru-kun}! I’m in total awe!</b>

28:13.677 --> 28:15.967
<b>Chitty-Chitty Snow Festival?</b>

28:14.837 --> 28:17.307
<b>Uh-huh, I know it!</b>

28:17.307 --> 28:19.517
<b>All right, Rem! I’m enlisting your help!</b>

28:17.637 --> 28:20.927
<b>What’s the “Chitty-Chitty” part for?</b>

28:19.517 --> 28:20.307
<b>Chitty-Chitty!</b>

28:20.307 --> 28:22.347
<b>Let’s get this thing on!</b>

28:22.347 --> 28:23.557
<b>Okay!</b>

28:25.647 --> 28:32.147
