<b>TOURNAMENT</b>

28:26.607 --> 28:32.147
Roswaal Manor • Arlam Village

28:26.607 --> 28:32.147
{=30}Roswaal Manor • Arlam Village

28:37.657 --> 28:41.577
<b>The falling snow envelops 
the mansion along with our hearts.</b>

28:41.577 --> 28:44.827
<b>As far as the eye can see, 
it’s nothing but white, white, white!</b>

28:44.827 --> 28:48.997
<b>But, just as there is no endless night, 
there is no endless snow!</b>

28:48.997 --> 28:50.837
<b>Kiss the cold sky goodbye.</b>

28:50.837 --> 28:53.417
<b>It’s time for the Roswaal Manor 
Out-of-Season Snow Festival!</b>

28:54.127 --> 28:57.347
<b>Hey, who wants to go to New York?</b>

28:57.347 --> 28:59.057
<b>New York?</b>

28:59.057 --> 29:00.257
<b>Huh, where?</b>

28:59.057 --> 29:00.257
<b>Yeah!</b>

29:00.257 --> 29:04.227
<b>Do you want to go to New York, 
no matter what it takes?</b>

29:04.227 --> 29:05.727
<b>Y-Yeah!</b>

29:05.727 --> 29:07.437
<b>Where’s New York?</b>

29:07.437 --> 29:10.017
<b>Subaru said it’s a town in his homeland.</b>

29:10.017 --> 29:12.147
<b>He said it’s a town flurrying with love and lust!</b>

29:12.147 --> 29:13.437
<b>Flurrying!</b>

29:13.437 --> 29:14.947
<b>The rules are simple.</b>

29:14.947 --> 29:18.907
<b>You will put your creativity and imagination 
to the test by creating snow sculptures.</b>

29:18.907 --> 29:22.747
<b>The winner will get a splendid prize.</b>

29:22.747 --> 29:24.867
<b>Do we get to go to New York?</b>

29:24.867 --> 29:26.867
<b>Sorry, that’s a little out of the question.</b>

29:27.327 --> 29:31.837
<b>But we’ve prepared prizes even greater 
than going to New York.</b>

29:32.167 --> 29:35.047
<b>Now, give it your best and aim for victory!</b>

29:35.047 --> 29:37.087
<b>Yeah!</b>

29:39.547 --> 29:43.427
<b>A snow festival, though. 
The thought never crossed my mind.</b>

29:43.427 --> 29:47.767
<b>If you can’t hide it, you might as well 
make a big festival out of it.</b>

29:49.107 --> 29:52.527
<b>I’m going to toil and moil until I make 
something amazing of my own.</b>

29:53.027 --> 29:56.027
<b>“Toil and moil,” huh? Not something 
you hear much these days.</b>

30:04.497 --> 30:06.077
<b>Oh, found ya, Beako.</b>

30:06.367 --> 30:08.707
<b>Looks like it all worked out.</b>

30:08.707 --> 30:12.587
<b>Thanks for widening the barrier a little bit.</b>

30:12.587 --> 30:15.207
<b>It’s far too rambunctious here now.</b>

30:15.207 --> 30:19.837
<b>I should have extended the barrier to the forest 
so the festivities took place in the village, I suppose.</b>

30:19.837 --> 30:22.637
<b>That would’ve troubled the villagers,</b>

30:22.637 --> 30:27.807
<b>and more importantly, ruined the secret flower 
garden I’m taking Emilia-tan to for our first date.</b>

30:27.807 --> 30:30.857
<b>What of it? Beatrice doesn’t see how that’s any of her concern.</b>

30:31.107 --> 30:34.647
<b>Anyways, aren’t you gonna join us, Beako?</b>

30:34.647 --> 30:36.067
<b>You don’t have to hold back.</b>

30:36.067 --> 30:39.027
<b>And who exactly is holding back?</b>

30:39.027 --> 30:41.817
<b>Betty is a very busy woman. Shoo, shoo!</b>

30:42.697 --> 30:44.367
<b>Don’t be like that.</b>

30:44.367 --> 30:46.867
<b>It’s important to go outside 
and play sometimes too.</b>

30:46.867 --> 30:49.917
<b>That goes double for kids.</b>

30:51.417 --> 30:52.957
<b>Buenos Aires!</b>

30:56.297 --> 30:57.797
<b>Hey, it’s Subaru!</b>

30:57.797 --> 30:59.127
<b>Yeah, it’s Subaru!</b>

30:59.127 --> 31:01.047
<b>Taste the wrath of the White Terror!</b>

31:01.047 --> 31:04.467
<b>The cold doesn’t phase you guys one bit, huh?</b>

31:04.467 --> 31:05.767
<b>But…</b>

31:06.467 --> 31:11.557
<b>One day, you’ll realize that the one’s 
being played by the snow</b>

31:11.557 --> 31:14.357
<b>were you yourselves.</b>

31:17.317 --> 31:19.777
<b>You were saying?</b>

31:19.777 --> 31:22.157
<b>I take it back!</b>

31:22.157 --> 31:25.617
<b>Subaru! Look, look! I made this out of the snow.</b>

31:25.987 --> 31:28.327
<b>Nice, a snow bunny.</b>

31:28.327 --> 31:31.117
<b>Isn’t he cute?</b>

31:31.117 --> 31:32.827
<b>Did I do good?</b>

31:32.827 --> 31:34.497
<b>You did awesome!</b>

31:34.497 --> 31:35.957
<b>I’ve got an idea.</b>

31:35.957 --> 31:38.507
<b>Let’s spruce it up a bit.</b>

31:38.507 --> 31:39.667
<b>Watch this.</b>

31:43.427 --> 31:44.677
<b>Wow!</b>

31:44.677 --> 31:47.137
<b>It’s a bunny! A bunny!</b>

31:47.137 --> 31:51.267
<b>Seeing you so happy gets me all fired up too.</b>

31:51.267 --> 31:55.107
<b>All right, let’s give that thing 
some more power-ups!</b>

31:55.107 --> 31:57.477
<b>We’ll give it a tail and some wings.</b>

31:57.977 --> 32:01.947
<b>And load it up with missiles, 
a body makeover, a cockpit, and some treads!</b>

32:01.947 --> 32:04.027
<b>W-Wait, please!</b>

32:07.117 --> 32:08.287
<b>How’s that?</b>

32:08.287 --> 32:17.087
<b>The Flying Assault Incinerator 
Ultimate Weapon Snow Bunn—</b>

32:18.707 --> 32:22.877
<b>I guess Petra is more of a real robot person 
than a super robot person.</b>

32:26.887 --> 32:30.467
<b>Really, what an outrageous man.</b>

32:31.137 --> 32:34.267
<b>Subaru probably wants you to join in on the fun.</b>

32:34.977 --> 32:38.017
<b>I’d actually like to myself.</b>

32:38.647 --> 32:40.277
<b>Bubby.</b>

32:51.577 --> 32:52.817
<b>Beatrice?</b>

32:53.747 --> 32:56.287
<b>I’m only here at Bubby’s insistence.</b>

32:56.287 --> 32:58.497
<b>I’ll grace you with my companionship a while.</b>

32:58.497 --> 33:00.127
<b>Be grateful.</b>

33:03.087 --> 33:04.837
<b>I won’t hold back!</b>

33:13.767 --> 33:16.267
<b>Everyone’s doing some nice work.</b>

33:16.267 --> 33:21.147
<b>For sure, but it’s a bit of a letdown that most 
of the designs are pretty grounded in reality.</b>

33:21.437 --> 33:23.607
<b>Maybe they just don’t know a lot 
about character design?</b>

33:23.607 --> 33:25.817
<b>There’s lots of castles and animals.</b>

33:27.617 --> 33:30.077
<b>Wow, this is pretty well—</b>

33:30.077 --> 33:31.367
<b>Done?</b>

33:33.787 --> 33:35.707
<b>Thank you very much, {*}Master Subaru{*Subaru-sama}.</b>

33:35.707 --> 33:37.537
<b>I feel pretty good about my wolgarm piece.</b>

33:37.537 --> 33:41.047
<b>The freezing cold isn’t going to make me forget 
how freaking scary these things are!</b>

33:41.047 --> 33:42.297
<b>This is no joke!</b>

33:42.297 --> 33:46.257
<b>The strong impact of it is to my liking, 
and I give you an A for effort.</b>

33:46.257 --> 33:51.467
<b>But because you didn’t take into account 
the judge’s emotional trauma, I give you a seven!</b>

33:54.227 --> 33:56.697
<b>Okay! It’s really shaping up.</b>

33:58.557 --> 34:00.267
<b>Hey, no cheating!</b>

34:00.267 --> 34:03.067
<b>You can’t do that!</b>

34:03.067 --> 34:06.607
<b>It’s not written anywhere that this isn’t allowed.</b>

34:06.607 --> 34:09.017
<b>Nope! No magic!</b>

34:09.617 --> 34:11.157
<b>Unfair advantages are not okay.</b>

34:11.157 --> 34:13.907
<b>You should grasp victory using nothing 
but your own two hands.</b>

34:26.257 --> 34:28.837
<b>This is quite the superb view.</b>

34:28.837 --> 34:33.967
<b>By the way, who’s doing the scoring for the festival?</b>

34:33.967 --> 34:39.057
<b>Me, Ros-chi, and the village chief as a secret judge.</b>

34:39.307 --> 34:45.937
<b>If his identity is revealed, some might try 
to bribe him for a better score.</b>

34:45.937 --> 34:49.737
<b>Would anyone really go that far 
to get the special prize?</b>

34:49.737 --> 34:54.537
<b>It’s a one-of-a-kind, 
super-gorgeous prize from me.</b>

34:54.537 --> 34:59.457
<b>Wow, you’re sure being generous when 
this whole thing isn’t your problem.</b>

34:59.457 --> 35:04.747
<b>Emilia-tan and you are in a tight spot, 
so it’s only a given I’d do whatever I can to help.</b>

35:04.747 --> 35:09.967
<b>Oh? I think that’s quite, you know, <i>that</i> of you.</b>

35:09.967 --> 35:14.257
<b>You’re gonna have to spell it out some more 
if you want me to understand you.</b>

35:14.257 --> 35:15.557
<b>That a fact?</b>

35:15.557 --> 35:17.477
<b>{*}Subaru{*Subaru-kun}, take a look here.</b>

35:17.477 --> 35:20.557
<b>It’s a collaborative work by the Rem×Ram sisters.</b>

35:20.557 --> 35:22.267
<b>You and your sister, huh?</b>

35:22.267 --> 35:24.727
<b>So you’re not just helping. 
You’re participating too?</b>

35:24.727 --> 35:25.727
<b>Oh, Barusu.</b>

35:25.727 --> 35:29.447
<b>You came because you just couldn’t help 
but gravitate towards our superior artistry?</b>

35:29.447 --> 35:33.447
<b>The way you make it sound like I’m an insect 
drawn to the light is hardly flattering,</b>

35:33.447 --> 35:34.827
<b>but yeah, that’s the gist of it.</b>

35:34.827 --> 35:38.447
<b>I can hardly believe you of all people are 
taking part in this hella cold festival.</b>

35:39.117 --> 35:44.877
<b>What, should I have stayed in bed while 
Rem and you lot had fun outside?</b>

35:44.877 --> 35:49.667
<b>That was an unnecessarily aggressive way to say it, 
but basically, you didn’t want to be left out?</b>

35:50.047 --> 35:54.347
<b>I really wanted to play with my sister, 
so I did everything I could to make her come.</b>

35:54.347 --> 35:58.807
<b>Do you feel guilty making your little 
sis go so far just to get you out?</b>

35:58.807 --> 36:02.227
<b>Feeling Rem’s love so strongly 
gives me a sense of superiority.</b>

36:02.227 --> 36:03.397
<b>You should be jealous.</b>

36:05.977 --> 36:07.107
<b>What do we have here?</b>

36:08.317 --> 36:09.817
<b>Ram×Rem.</b>

36:09.817 --> 36:13.317
<b>It’s a work of art built through our 
combined power, skill, and sisterly love.</b>

36:13.657 --> 36:16.947
<b>Yes. I followed my sister’s instructions 
and used the best of my meager talents</b>

36:16.947 --> 36:18.737
<b>to create what is likely the ultimate sculpture.</b>

36:18.737 --> 36:21.827
<b>You just gave away the fact 
Ram did nothing but watch!</b>

36:21.827 --> 36:24.127
<b>So what do you call it?</b>

36:24.127 --> 36:25.167
<b>Yes!</b>

36:25.167 --> 36:28.337
<b>We call it the Wonderful Subawaal.</b>

36:28.337 --> 36:30.297
<b>I can picture it from the name alone!</b>

36:30.667 --> 36:31.687
<b>Without further ado…</b>

36:41.977 --> 36:47.517
<b>My sister wanted to make Roswaal, and I wanted 
to make Subaru, so our opinions were split.</b>

36:48.437 --> 36:51.817
<b>This is the compromise that we agreed upon.</b>

36:51.817 --> 36:54.027
<b>What a half-baked compromise!</b>

36:54.027 --> 36:56.407
<b>Well, well.</b>

36:56.407 --> 36:59.867
<b>What brings about this congregation?</b>

37:00.407 --> 37:02.037
<b>Oh, and what is this?</b>

37:02.707 --> 37:07.837
<b>{*}Master Roswaal{*Roswaal-sama}, it’s a bit embarrassing, 
but please take a look at this.</b>

37:07.837 --> 37:09.627
<b>It’s a Rem×Ram collaboration.</b>

37:09.627 --> 37:12.757
<b>Even though we are like family, 
please give us your fair, unbiased appraisal.</b>

37:20.677 --> 37:23.767
<b>Okay. It sucks, but the best I can give you is a five.</b>

37:23.767 --> 37:25.437
<b>Nice. Good one!</b>

37:25.437 --> 37:27.857
<b>It’s no joke! That’s my honest evaluation!</b>

37:27.857 --> 37:30.857
<b>I’ll be praying for your future success!</b>

37:32.987 --> 37:35.907
<b>N-No! I can’t believe it.</b>

37:35.907 --> 37:37.737
<b>What about you, {*}Master Roswaal{*Roswaal-sama}?</b>

37:40.277 --> 37:41.877
<b>Y-Yes! Ugh.</b>

37:43.447 --> 37:45.457
<b><i>Four points?</i></b>

37:47.667 --> 37:49.667
<b>By the way, what’s the highest score?</b>

37:49.667 --> 37:51.127
<b>Ten points.</b>

37:51.127 --> 37:55.167
<b>With all three judges, thirty is a perfect score.</b>

37:55.167 --> 37:58.677
<b>It’s not an issue of craftsmanship.</b>

37:58.677 --> 38:00.257
<b>It’s more that</b>

38:00.637 --> 38:02.967
<b>it’s a tad disturbing.</b>

38:03.467 --> 38:06.057
<b>It was a solid idea!</b>

38:06.057 --> 38:08.397
<b>Barusu’s likeness brought the whole thing down!</b>

38:08.397 --> 38:09.857
<b>Not true!</b>

38:09.857 --> 38:14.107
<b>Something must be wrong here, 
for a Rem×Ram brainchild to fail!</b>

