49:30.077 --> 49:32.077
<b>It generally points you north.</b>

49:32.077 --> 49:34.577
<b>You’re pointing south. 
The exact opposite, I suppose.</b>

49:34.577 --> 49:36.707
<b>O-Okay, then that M there!</b>

49:36.707 --> 49:40.997
<b>Those ones lined up like an M are called Cassiopeia.</b>

49:40.997 --> 49:45.587
<b>I have no idea what an “M” is, 
and I don’t see any shape either.</b>

49:46.427 --> 49:47.927
<b>What are you doing, Barusu?</b>

49:48.677 --> 49:52.387
<b>What’s going on? Sharing secrets?</b>

49:50.307 --> 49:52.387
<b>{*}Subaru{*Subaru-kun}, {*}Subaru{*Subaru-kun}, {*}Subaru{*Subaru-kun}.</b>

49:52.387 --> 49:54.427
<b>Oh hey! Listen up, everyone.</b>

49:54.427 --> 49:56.937
<b>We’re talking about the shining stars in the sky.</b>

49:56.937 --> 49:58.227
<b>Oh, the stars!</b>

49:58.227 --> 49:59.437
<b>{*}Subaru{*Subaru-kun}, {*}Subaru{*Subaru-kun}.</b>

49:59.437 --> 50:00.357
<b>Okay!</b>

50:01.727 --> 50:04.647
<b>Now, what we’ve all been waiting for.</b>

50:04.647 --> 50:06.567
<b>Together now!</b>

50:08.617 --> 50:10.527
<b>Let’s search for Subaru.</b>

50:08.617 --> 50:10.527
<b>TL Note: Subaru is the Japanese name for Pleiades star cluster</b>

50:15.577 --> 50:18.917
<b>Wait up! Don’t pity me! Don’t disdain me! 
It’s not what you think.</b>

50:18.917 --> 50:23.667
<b>Subaru is my name, but I was named after a star.</b>

50:23.667 --> 50:29.427
<b>Bestowing the name of a star twinkling 
in the sky on the likes of you. What cruel parents.</b>

50:29.427 --> 50:33.967
<b>Despite being named after a star, you don’t shine, 
and you don’t catch people’s attention.</b>

50:33.967 --> 50:34.557
<b>How pitiful.</b>

50:34.557 --> 50:37.387
<b>Quit it with the passive-aggressive insults 
about me not living up to my name!</b>

50:37.387 --> 50:38.977
<b>Don’t worry about it!</b>

50:38.977 --> 50:41.187
<b>Stars are a symbol of hope.</b>

50:41.187 --> 50:44.317
<b>So you can still have hope.</b>

50:44.317 --> 50:46.817
<b>You’re enjoying yourself too much.</b>

50:50.567 --> 50:52.117
<b>Look! Look!</b>

50:52.117 --> 50:54.117
<b>So many snow spirits!</b>

50:55.287 --> 51:00.077
<b>Whoa, awesome!</b>

51:18.097 --> 51:19.597
<b>So…</b>

51:20.267 --> 51:22.557
<b>Wasn’t the snow festival fun?</b>

51:35.077 --> 51:37.407
<b>It wasn’t terrible.</b>

51:37.407 --> 51:39.707
<b>That’s all you’ll get out of me, I suppose.</b>

51:44.207 --> 51:45.377
<b>All right!</b>

51:45.377 --> 51:51.967
<b>I’ll use up the rest of my mana to share 
the snow with everyone in the capital!</b>

52:42.767 --> 52:45.307
<b>Well, well.</b>

52:45.307 --> 52:49.277
<b>Have you had enough of your 
rendezvous with Subaru?</b>

52:49.277 --> 52:52.237
<b>You’d be wise to keep the jokes 
to your fashion sense, I suppose.</b>

52:52.237 --> 52:54.857
<b>That wasn’t funny in the least.</b>

52:54.857 --> 52:57.947
<b>Oh my, you just can’t be sincere with yourself.</b>

53:02.457 --> 53:03.707
<b>This is for you.</b>

53:03.707 --> 53:08.587
<b>It must’ve been harsh not to partake 
a single drop during a feast.</b>

53:09.497 --> 53:11.047
<b>I’ll pass, I suppose.</b>

53:11.047 --> 53:13.507
<b>Out of consideration for {*}Subaru{*Subaru-kun}?</b>

53:14.127 --> 53:16.677
<b>Don’t misunderstand.</b>

53:16.677 --> 53:21.977
<b>Betty didn’t decide not to drink because 
of that little brat’s objections.</b>

53:21.977 --> 53:24.727
<b>A long time ago, I was told not to by my mother.</b>

53:24.727 --> 53:26.227
<b>No more than that.</b>

53:30.727 --> 53:33.947
<b>What he says is of no importance to Betty, I suppose.</b>

53:58.677 --> 54:03.767
<b>Maybe we should have consulted with Subaru 
about your manastruation from the get-go.</b>

54:03.767 --> 54:07.687
<b>That way, we wouldn’t have wasted so much time 
worrying about him finding out.</b>

54:07.687 --> 54:09.307
<b>I guess so.</b>

54:09.307 --> 54:14.567
<b>But you shouldn’t grow up to be someone 
dependent on other people for everything.</b>

54:14.567 --> 54:18.777
<b>Even if something is out of your reach, you should 
keep trying until you know for sure, right?</b>

54:18.777 --> 54:20.737
<b>Yes, I know.</b>

54:20.737 --> 54:21.907
<b>Very well.</b>

54:23.447 --> 54:26.867
<b>Hey, do you remember what 
Subaru said during the toast?</b>

54:27.917 --> 54:31.917
<b>If I have another manastruation next year, 
let’s hold another snow festival.</b>

54:31.917 --> 54:37.587
<b>Normally that kind of thing would annoy people, 
but he can really turn it into a festivity.</b>

54:38.127 --> 54:43.557
<b>That part of him really makes me think he has “it.”</b>

54:43.557 --> 54:47.017
<b>That’s right. I feel the same way.</b>

54:47.637 --> 54:49.227
<b>Next year, huh?</b>

54:49.227 --> 54:53.977
<b>I have no idea what will happen so far into the future.</b>

54:54.607 --> 54:59.487
<b>I’ll be happy as long as it goes 
the way you want it to.</b>

54:59.487 --> 55:04.447
<b>We don’t know whether what Subaru 
says will actually be possible.</b>

55:04.447 --> 55:07.367
<b>Are you opposed to the snow festival?</b>

55:07.367 --> 55:09.037
<b>Of course not.</b>

55:09.037 --> 55:12.587
<b>I enjoyed it, and you looked like you did too.</b>

55:13.497 --> 55:19.177
<b>But I don’t know if Subaru will still be happy 
staying by your side next year.</b>

55:20.427 --> 55:24.177
<b>His belly wound as well as the bite 
wounds from the witchbeasts.</b>

55:24.177 --> 55:28.387
<b>All those scars are the result of your actions.</b>

55:28.387 --> 55:32.857
<b>I’m sure it’s not the kind of thing you just forget, 
but you still have to keep it in mind.</b>

55:33.817 --> 55:34.857
<b>Yeah.</b>

55:35.317 --> 55:38.607
<b>But it would be nice if we could do it again 
next year. A snow festival, that is.</b>

55:38.607 --> 55:44.487
<b>That would mean I’d have stored up enough mana 
to trigger another manastruation.</b>

55:44.487 --> 55:47.827
<b>And Subaru is the only one who could lead a festival.</b>

55:48.957 --> 55:51.867
<b>True. You’re right.</b>

55:51.867 --> 55:52.667
<b>Yeah.</b>

55:53.667 --> 55:56.297
<b>I totally agree with you.</b>

55:58.417 --> 55:59.757
<b>Is something wrong?</b>

56:00.507 --> 56:03.217
<b>No, not at all.</b>

56:03.217 --> 56:06.177
<b>It’s going to be pretty hot today, so be careful.</b>

56:06.177 --> 56:08.017
<b>Okay. See you later.</b>

56:24.947 --> 56:26.157
<b>Did I make you wait?</b>

56:26.157 --> 56:28.487
<b>No, I just got here.</b>

56:37.377 --> 56:39.377
<b>Well then, let’s get going.</b>

56:45.507 --> 56:46.087
<b>Yeah!</b>

